questions.corrige_markdown:
*Diagram to be drawn by the candidate.* Draw a large **front view (vertical section) of the female reproductive system**, using clean lines. It must show and label:

- the two **ovaries** and the **oviducts (fallopian tubes)** with their funnel-shaped **fimbriae (ciliated openings)**;
- the **uterus (womb)** with its muscular wall and lining (**endometrium**);
- the **cervix** (neck of the uterus);
- the **vagina**;
- the **vulva** (external opening), and optionally the **urethra**, **bladder** and **rectum** (as neighbouring organs).

Add a title ("Diagram of the female reproductive system") and ruled labelling lines.
